enza incidence was estimated using Chile’s Ministry of Health (Ministerio de Salud [MINSAL]) Department of Statistics and Health Information hospital discharge data\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The age group–specific proportion was calculated by age group and by month, totaled for each age group,\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The start of the influenza season for each calendar year during 2017–19 and in 2022 was defined as the epidemiologic week during which the percentage of influenza-positive specimens had exceeded the historical epidemic threshold for ≥3 weeks.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"VE estimates were calculated as 1 − odds ratio x 100 and adjusted for age, month of symptom onset, and preexisting conditions.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"only cases for which P&I was the principal diagnosis associated with hospitalization were included in calculations\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}